  software.
title: ThreeBody3D
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Grace
    given-names: Ian
repository-code: https://github.com/IanGraceNz/ThreeBody3D
repository-artifact: https://github.com/IanGraceNz/ThreeBody3D/releases
url: https://github.com/IanGraceNz/ThreeBody3D
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-07-19
abstract: >-
  ThreeBody3D is a Julia package for numerical integration and scientific
  validation of the Newtonian three-body problem in three spatial dimensions.
  It provides high-accuracy numerical integration, validation benchmarks,
  Levi-Civita regularization, Kustaanheimo-Stiefel regularization, and
  experimental automatic regularization switching for close encounters.
keywords:
  - Julia
  - three-body problem
  - celestial mechanics
  - numerical integration
  - orbital dynamics
  - regularization
  - Levi-Civita
  - Kustaanheimo-Stiefel
  - scientific computing
